  "description": "Stocks are still working. But there comes a point when protecting capital, and waiting for better prices, makes more sense.",
  "body_html": "<p>A friendly reminder, the economy is NOT the stock market. We have had a consistent barrage of negative headlines, for years at this point, and yet, the stock market continues to climb higher. </p><p>However, there are times when I decide to sit out of the market. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yiIa!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F19debb6c-801e-421d-aa11-a3f06156ca00_1212x872.webp\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yiIa!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F19debb6c-801e-421d-aa11-a3f06156ca00_1212x872.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yiIa!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F19debb6c-801e-421d-aa11-a3f06156ca00_1212x872.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yiIa!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F19debb6c-801e-421d-aa11-a3f06156ca00_1212x872.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yiIa!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F19debb6c-801e-421d-aa11-a3f06156ca00_1212x872.webp 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yiIa!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F19debb6c-801e-421d-aa11-a3f06156ca00_1212x872.webp\" width=\"1212\" height=\"872\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/19debb6c-801e-421d-aa11-a3f06156ca00_1212x872.webp&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:872,&quot;width&quot;:1212,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:55078,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/webp&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/212418743?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F19debb6c-801e-421d-aa11-a3f06156ca00_1212x872.webp&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yiIa!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F19debb6c-801e-421d-aa11-a3f06156ca00_1212x872.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yiIa!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F19debb6c-801e-421d-aa11-a3f06156ca00_1212x872.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yiIa!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F19debb6c-801e-421d-aa11-a3f06156ca00_1212x872.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yiIa!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F19debb6c-801e-421d-aa11-a3f06156ca00_1212x872.webp 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h4>There is NO perfect signal or clue. </h4><p>But these are general rules that I follow. Feel free to adjust them slightly to your own strategy. </p><ol><li><p>VIX is greater than 21, I do nothing. I often may even trim stocks not performing. </p></li><li><p>The proven strategy, is NOT working. No strategy works 100% of the time. So do not force trades that take away all your prior gains. </p></li><li><p>More 52 week lows than 52 week highs. I check this weekly. </p><p></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p></li></ol><p>Keep it simple. If you overcomplicate it, you will not get a better answer, and just exhaust yourself. </p><p>Enjoy the rest of your Sunday. weekly wrap up below! </p><h4>Please like ❤️ and re-stack 🔄 if you benefited from this post!</h4><p>I’ll see you all tomorrow!</p><div class=\"digest-post-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;nodeId&quot;:&quot;b59d943f-0875-4212-b706-0a01287a85fc&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Happy Saturday! Hope you are enjoying the weekend and disconnecting a bit. We had a boring week in the market…but that’s not a bad thing. There is always a “quiet” before the big moves. The market was like this, before yet again, hitting another all time high; despite the negative headlines!&quot;,&quot;cta&quot;:null,&quot;showBylines&quot;:true,&quot;showDescription&quot;:true,&quot;showImage&quot;:true,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;lg&quot;,&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Silver Breaking Out, What Comes Next - Weekly Wrap Up&quot;,&quot;publishedBylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:301052325,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Investing • Market Analyst • 580,000 on TikTok • USNA • Featured on Business Insider &amp; Yahoo Finance • NO POLITICS&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8add7fc9-8edc-4748-ba33-360428e75ee1_1206x1206.png&quot;,&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:1000}],&quot;post_date&quot;:&quot;2026-08-22T13:54:34.045Z&quot;,&quot;cover_image&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ljKc!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffa274a67-f56d-4779-8fa4-ff117c99cc8c_1400x861.png&quot;,&quot;cover_image_alt&quot;:null,&quot;canonical_url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/silver-breaking-out-what-comes-next&quot;,&quot;section_name&quot;:null,&quot;video_upload_id&quot;: